# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).


## [3.2.0] - 2021-05-10
### Fixed
- Reader: fix start/stop iteration
- ShardedReader: fix IndexError in get

### Added
- Experimental PyTorch dataset integration


## [3.1.0] - 2021-03-15
### Changed
- Massive improvements to the overall speed and efficiency of the library
- New index format that allows lazy-loading of keys
- Add Bloom filter and key hashes for fast contains checks
- Much faster iteration for MsgpackReader over high-latency network connections or busy disks

### Added
- Introduce get and slice methods to all Reader classes
- Readers support __getitem__ indexing including slices, though only for step==1
- Zero-copy support for MsgpackReader
- QuasiShuffler for efficient random iteration of readers
- ShardedReader that combines sharded datasets into one large Reader.


## [3.0.2] - 2020-11-02
### Fixed
- YFCC100m: fix order of key & sample


## [3.0.1] - 2020-06-22
### Changed
- ILSVRC2012: use 1 thread by default

### Fixed
- ILSVRC2012: fix incorrect argument name


## [3.0.0] - 2020-06-19
### Added
-  Initial public release.


